{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LightPoint\u00a0</strong>is a free-form real-time strategy (RTS) tower defense game.<br>As an &quot;Anchor,&quot; you'll battle enigmatic Graphical Entities and bring light to those trapped in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Harvest resources, build defenses</strong>, and hold the line until victory is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face challenging bosses</strong> and master diverse build strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extras/\u73a9\u6cd5\u5c55\u793a.gif?t=1750507398\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 <strong>Real-Time Strategy</strong>: Build defenses at any moment \u2013 prepare strategically or react under pressure. Protect your territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extras/\u5373\u65f6\u6218\u7565\u6f14\u793a.gif?t=1750507398\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Illuminate the Darkness</strong>: Deploy light sources to reveal the battlefield. New structures can ONLY be built in illuminated zones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extras/\u6218\u4e89\u8ff7\u96fe.gif?t=1750507398\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Tech &amp; Combat Synergy</strong>: Combine 60+ technologies to create powerful synergies and execute masterful tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extras/\u9009\u79d1\u6280.gif?t=1750507398\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More secrets await! Wishlist Now!</strong><br>Thank you for your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498100?t=1750507398","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498100?t=1750507398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/7d5a43c3c28515d6acdf94ad7fe14ba16b5342e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750507398","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/7d5a43c3c28515d6acdf94ad7fe14ba16b5342e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750507398","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LightPoint\u00a0</strong>is a free-form real-time strategy (RTS) tower defense game.<br>As an &quot;Anchor,&quot; you'll battle enigmatic Graphical Entities and bring light to those trapped in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Harvest resources, build defenses</strong>, and hold the line until victory is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face challenging bosses</strong> and master diverse build strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extras/\u73a9\u6cd5\u5c55\u793a.gif?t=1750507398\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a1 <strong>Real-Time Strategy</strong>: Build defenses at any moment \u2013 prepare strategically or react under pressure. Protect your territory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498100/extra